# | Advantech ADAM-6024 — Universal Analog I/O Module (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 6 analog inputs (AI) + 2 analog outputs (AO) + 2 DI + 2 DO.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC02 addr 0-1 (00001-00002): DI value ch 0-1 (R).
# | - FC01 addr 16-17 (00017-00018): DO value ch 0-1 (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 0-5: AI value ch 0-5 (u16 raw, 0-65535=full scale) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 10-11: AO value ch 0-1 (u16 raw) (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 20-25: AI status ch 0-5 (u16; bit0=normal, bit1=over high, bit2=over low, bit3=invalid cal) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 200-205: AI type code ch 0-5 (R/W; 7=4~20mA, 8=±10V, D=0~20mA).
# | - FC03 addr 208-209: AO type code ch 0-1 (R/W; 0=0~20mA, 1=4~20mA, 2=0~10V).
# | - FC03 addr 210: Module name (R).
# | - FC03 addr 220: AI channel enable ch 0-5 (R/W).
